==== hyperbricks yaml {!{fragment}} ====
fragment:
  - type: fragment
  - response:
      hx_redirect: /some/new/location
==== explainer ====
Can be used to do a client-side redirect to a new location
==== expected json ====
{
  "Cache": "",
